WEBVTT

00:01:30.583 --> 00:01:32.434
AG: Some people avoid negotiating.

00:01:32.458 --> 00:01:33.976
Others struggle at it,

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:37.268
and even good negotiators have bad habits.

00:01:37.292 --> 00:01:38.893
It's time to change that.

00:01:38.917 --> 00:01:41.708
(Upbeat music)

00:01:45.417 --> 00:01:48.976
I'm Adam Grant, and this is WorkLife,
my podcast with TED.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:50.893
I'm an organizational psychologist.

00:01:50.917 --> 00:01:54.101
I study how to make work not suck.

00:01:54.125 --> 00:01:56.518
In this show, I'm inviting
myself inside the minds

00:01:56.542 --> 00:01:58.393
of some truly unusual people,

00:01:58.417 --> 00:02:02.101
because they've mastered something
I wish everyone knew about work.